Cell[BoxData["\<\"Born massive invariant amplitudes.\\n Format - double array \
of invariant amplitude number and m-series coefficient.\\n Series starts from \
\\!\\(\\*SuperscriptBox[\\(m\\), \\(0\\)]\\).\\n Notations: \
T=\\!\\(\\*FractionBox[\\(\\*SuperscriptBox[SubscriptBox[\\(m\\), \\(e\\)], \
\\(2\\)] - t\\), \\(s\\)]\\), m=\\!\\(\\*FractionBox[SubscriptBox[\\(m\\), \
\\(e\\)], SqrtBox[\\(s\\)]]\\).\"\>"], "Print",
